[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_22]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_22_desc]
“Make Cloudsdale Airforce Great Again!”\n\n“Is this slogan created by Duchess Derpy?”\n“Of course not, it’s by the consultant hired from Stratusburg.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_22_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about air force, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_22]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_22_desc]
“让云中城空军再次伟大！”\n\n“这是呆蹄领主想出来的口号吗？”\n“当然不是，是层云堡请来的顾问写的。”

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_22_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于空军的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

